{"last_link_id": 32, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": [" - [S1]哈喽，AI时代的冲浪先锋们！欢迎收听《AI生活进行时》。啊，一个充满了未来  感，然后，还有一点点，<|laughter|>神经质的播客节目，我是主持人小希。\n - [S2]哎，大家好呀！我是能唠，爱唠，天天都想唠的唠嗑！\n - [S1]最近活得特别赛博朋克哈！以前觉得AI是科幻片里的，<|sigh|> 现在，现在连我妈都用AI写广场舞文案了。\n - [S2]<|laughter|>这个例子很生动啊。是的，特别是生成式AI哈，感觉都要炸了！ 诶，那我们今天就聊聊AI<|breathing|>AI是怎么走进我们的生活的哈！\n - [S1]没错。\n - [S2]<|coughing|>，比如ChatGPT的写作能力啊，我有个程序员朋友，现在用ChatGPT三分钟<|breathing|>三分钟就能写出感情充沛的周报，<|laughter|>把老板都看傻了都。\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [750, 160], "pos": [205.77613830566406, 3641.781005859375], "id": 35, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 88], "pos": [1287.3721923828125, 3853.85400390625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 24, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 42, "type": "PreviewAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.66", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"audioUI": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAudio"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "SOULX_MODEL", "links": [22, 25], "label": "SOULX_MODEL", "type": "SOULX_MODEL", "localized_name": "SOULX_MODEL"}], "size": [300, 154], "pos": [-162.6812744140625, 3856.648193359375], "widgets_values": ["SoulX-Podcast-1.7B-dialect", "hf", false, 692063061, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "llm_engine"}, "name": "llm_engine", "label": "llm_engine", "type": "COMBO", "loca