,\n        \"dialect_prompt\": \"<|Sichuan|>要得要得！前头几个耍洋盘，我后脚就背起铺盖卷去景德镇耍泥巴，巴适得喊老天爷！\"\n      },\n      \"S2\": {\n        \"prompt_audio\": \"example/audios/male_mandarin.wav\",\n        \"prompt_text\": \"呃，还有一个就是要跟大家纠正一点，就是我们在看电影的时候，尤其是游戏玩家，看电影的时候，在看到那个到西北那边的这个陕北民谣，嗯，这个可能在想，哎，是不是他是受到了黑神话的启发？\",\n        \"dialect_prompt\": \"<|Yue|>，又跟广东靓仔学了句“猴赛雷”，现在走路都带三省混音，气势拉满！T8你就给我在家抱着显卡哭，等老娘心情好了再考虑把你从黑名单里放出来，到时候记得把搓衣板换成火锅底料，跪起来才够味儿！\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"text\": [\n      [\"S1\", \""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 45, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [30], "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-458.6871032714844, 4469.150390625], "widgets_values": ["\"]\n    ]\n  }"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 48, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["只需要改这里提示词，其他的不要动！！"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-814.0640869140625, 4656.